Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}October 1918.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:05.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Meuse-Argonne, in northeastern France, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}American army is fighting its greatest battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Over 47 days, more than a million Americans will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:12.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}take part.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
