Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}THE MEUSE VALLEY · NOV. 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:28.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But for every American killed in battle in this war,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}about four more were wounded.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.47,0:00:30.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 995 0 l 995 132 l 0 132{\p0}
