Dialogue: 3,0:00:25.47,0:00:30.08,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WOUNDED CARRIED TO THE REAR · MEUSE-ARGONNE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:32.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So imagine you are one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You are an infantryman in the American Expeditionary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:37.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A shell bursts nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Something hits you.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.38,0:00:36.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 910 0 l 910 132 l 0 132{\p0}
