Dialogue: 3,0:00:30.38,0:00:36.13,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AMERICAN INFANTRY ADVANCE · AISNE-MARNE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Doctors knew they had about 12 hours to operate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}before infection could take hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:56.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In a big battle, the roads were jammed, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:58.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}stretcher bearers waited for dark, and the clock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:00:59.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}kept running.
