Dialogue: 3,0:00:49.13,0:00:54.88,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAFFIC ON THE ROADS · MEUSE-ARGONNE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This is what happened to a wounded American in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:03.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}First World War.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:07.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Step by step, from the moment he was hit to the day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}he came home, from the Army's own records.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.33,0:01:06.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
