Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Long before most American combat troops reached
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:23.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}France, American medical units were already there.
