Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Harvard's unit had reached France less than a month
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:33.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}after its call for volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Over the war, it treated more than 45,000 British
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:37.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and American patients.
