Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By the time the war ended, the Army Medical
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.23,0:02:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Department had grown into an army of its own.
