Dialogue: 3,0:02:38.70,0:02:44.45,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL WARDS GO UP · SAVENAY, FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its job was to take a man from the moment he was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hit, through a chain of stations that stretched
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:09.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hundreds of miles, all the way back to the United
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}States if it had to.
