Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:57.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Not what you might expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:59.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Not the bayonet charge from the movies.
