Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Other counts fill in the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This was an artillery war.
