Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:30.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At the start of the Argonne drive, the evacuation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:33.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hospitals, where most of the real surgery happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:36.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}were thirty to sixty kilometers behind the field
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:37.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hospitals.
