Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In practice, the roads were the problem.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:37.93,0:12:40.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 845 0 l 845 132 l 0 132{\p0}
