Dialogue: 3,0:12:37.93,0:12:40.21,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TRAFFIC ON THE ROADS · MEUSE-ARGONNE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Every road behind the front carried everything at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Ammunition going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Food going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Whole divisions moving in and out of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the ambulances, trying to come back.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:40.51,0:12:46.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
