Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Argonne, some roads were simply impassable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The walking wounded walked, because no ambulance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:05.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}could get to them.
