Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:09.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In October, ambulances bogged down in the mud of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:09.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Meuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Engineers worked day after day to keep the roads open.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:06.67,0:13:12.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 910 0 l 910 132 l 0 132{\p0}
