Dialogue: 3,0:13:06.67,0:13:12.42,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ENGINEERS REPAIR A ROAD · MEUSE-ARGONNE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On good days it was faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:36.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Soissons in July, the wounded were cleared from
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:39.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the battlefield within six hours. At St.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Mihiel, some reached an evacuation hospital within
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:44.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}three hours of being hit.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.78,0:13:37.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
