Dialogue: 3,0:13:31.78,0:13:37.53,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AID STATION · ANSAUVILLE · ST. MIHIEL
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:58.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}3 to 8 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:00.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Gone from your twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.35,0:14:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And you still had not seen a surgeon.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.03,0:14:03.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1060 0 l 1060 132 l 0 132{\p0}
