Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:14.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Each American division had four field hospitals, set
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}up about 6 to 8 miles behind the front, each with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:19.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}room for 216 patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}One of the four became the triage.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.29,0:14:17.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 995 0 l 995 132 l 0 132{\p0}
