Dialogue: 3,0:14:11.29,0:14:17.04,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AMBULANCE AT A FIELD HOSPITAL · AISNE-MARNE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:26.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its job was to sort, classify and distribute the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}To decide, quickly, who needed what, and who could
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:30.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}survive the trip further back.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.96,0:14:28.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1296 0 l 1296 132 l 0 132{\p0}
