Dialogue: 3,0:14:22.96,0:14:28.71,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL NO. 13, NEAR VENDEUIL-CAPLY · JULY 2, 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Here is how it worked at St.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Mihiel, in September 1918, for the 82nd Division.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.53,0:14:37.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1510 0 l 1510 132 l 0 132{\p0}
