Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Field Hospital 325 took the sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}326 took the gassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:53.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}327 took the seriously wounded.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:46.41,0:14:52.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
