Dialogue: 3,0:14:46.41,0:14:52.16,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TENT CAMP · MEUSE-ARGONNE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A man expected to recover in two weeks or less
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}stayed with the division.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:15:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Everyone else was prepared for the trip back.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.84,0:14:59.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1188 0 l 1188 132 l 0 132{\p0}
