Dialogue: 3,0:14:53.84,0:14:59.59,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL TENTS AND ARMY NURSES · 28TH DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:03.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army also tried bringing the surgeon closer to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:07.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Mobile hospitals, copied from the French, were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:10.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}designed to deliver lifesaving surgery near the front.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:00.79,0:15:06.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1060 0 l 1060 132 l 0 132{\p0}
