Dialogue: 3,0:15:00.79,0:15:06.54,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AMBULANCES AT A FIELD HOSPITAL · 80TH DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:34.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Surgery here was not meant to be final.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:37.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The mission, in the words of one history, was to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:40.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}first save lives, and then to prepare the patients
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}for the evacuation hospital.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.40,0:15:38.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1617 0 l 1617 132 l 0 132{\p0}
