Dialogue: 3,0:15:32.40,0:15:38.15,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITALS OF THE 4TH DIVISION, CHATEAU DE LA FORET · AUG. 10, 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Cantigny, in May 1918, one field hospital, No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:50.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}13, served as both the triage and the gas hospital.
