Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Because many of the men who reached the triage were
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:15:59.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}not just wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:00.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They were in shock.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:56.16,0:16:01.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1274 0 l 1274 132 l 0 132{\p0}
