Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:04.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Their circulation was failing, and no one yet fully
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:05.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}understood why.
