Dialogue: 3,0:16:01.36,0:16:05.56,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AID STATION · 89TH DIVISION · MEUSE-ARGONNE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An American physiologist from Harvard, Walter
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:20.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Cannon, went to France to study it in wounded soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:23.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He concluded the core problem was too little oxygen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:25.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}reaching the body's tissues.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.71,0:16:20.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1188 0 l 1188 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:16:14.71,0:16:20.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
