Dialogue: 3,0:16:14.71,0:16:20.46,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL TENTS AND ARMY NURSES · 28TH DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:29.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So the shock treatment at the triage was, above all,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}warmth and fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:33.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Wet clothes cut off. Blankets. Hot drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Salt water into a vein.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.44,0:16:32.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 982 0 l 982 132 l 0 132{\p0}
