Dialogue: 3,0:16:26.44,0:16:32.19,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}RECEPTION WARD, MOBILE HOSPITAL NO. 39
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:39.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In July 1918, the Army's surgical consultants sent a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}dedicated shock team to Field Hospital Number
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:42.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Twenty-Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was a sign of where things were going:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}treat the shock first, then the wound.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.96,0:16:41.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 995 0 l 995 132 l 0 132{\p0}
