Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:53.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And, if a team was there to do it, something new on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.67,0:16:54.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the battlefield:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}blood from a matched donor.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:50.99,0:16:56.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1274 0 l 1274 132 l 0 132{\p0}
