Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:18.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1914 and fifteen, doctors in Belgium, in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:22.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Argentina and in New York found that a little sodium
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}citrate kept blood from clotting.
