Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:28.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And in 1916, two American researchers, Peyton Rous
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:31.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and Joseph Turner, added sugar to the mix, so that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:32.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}blood could be stored.
