Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:41.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He came with Base Hospital No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:42.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}5, Harvard's unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He collected blood from group O donors, the type
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:48.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}that could be given to almost anyone, mixed it with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}citrate and sugar, sealed it in glass bottles, and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.81,0:17:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}packed it in ice.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:39.83,0:17:45.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
