Dialogue: 3,0:17:39.83,0:17:45.58,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}RECEIVING WARD, ALLEREY HOSPITAL CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Blood pressure, he wrote, rose by 20 to 40 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Britain awarded him its Distinguished Service Order.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.63,0:18:39.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
