Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:18:56.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}His report described 36 cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Blood, given quickly to a man in shock, could bring
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}him back from the edge.
