Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was still new, and still small.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But the idea of a blood bank, blood collected ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}of time, stored and ready, was born on the Western Front.
