Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today, the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:13.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}military still relies on that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And it still depends on donors.
