Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But in 1918, there was a wound that no amount of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:20.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}blood could fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It came on the wind.
