Dialogue: 3,0:19:37.30,0:19:43.05,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GAS CLOUD ACROSS NO-MAN'S-LAND
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Mustard was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}You might not notice it at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:50.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Symptoms could take hours to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It soaked through clothing and even leather, and it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}lingered on the ground for days.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:45.57,0:19:51.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:19:45.57,0:19:51.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:19:45.57,0:19:51.32,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:19:45.57,0:19:51.32,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GAS CLOUD ACROSS NO-MAN'S-LAND
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Many gassed men were temporarily blinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Most of them, later research found, recovered their sight.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:07.38,0:20:13.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:07.38,0:20:13.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:07.38,0:20:13.06,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:20:07.38,0:20:13.06,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GAS CLOUD ACROSS NO-MAN'S-LAND
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.11,0:20:16.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On the night of February 26, 1918, German gas
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}projectors fired on the American First Division in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:21.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the Ansauville sector.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:13.36,0:20:19.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:13.36,0:20:19.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:13.36,0:20:19.11,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:20:13.36,0:20:19.11,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SOLDIERS IN GAS MASKS
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:30.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Two of the eight died at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Six more died after they reached the field hospital.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:28.88,0:20:34.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:28.88,0:20:34.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:28.88,0:20:34.09,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:20:28.88,0:20:34.09,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GAS CLOUD ACROSS NO-MAN'S-LAND
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.37,0:20:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So every American carried a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:21:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At first they were British small box respirators,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:02.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}because American masks were not ready.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.62,0:21:01.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:55.62,0:21:01.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:20:55.62,0:21:01.37,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:20:55.62,0:21:01.37,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SOLDIERS IN GAS MASKS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The masks worked, but they were miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:06.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The straps gave men headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The eyepieces fogged.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.01,0:21:09.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Saliva pooled at the mouthpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Assistant Secretary of War said that the word
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:14.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}discomfort was a weak description.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.09,0:21:08.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:03.09,0:21:08.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:03.09,0:21:08.84,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:21:03.09,0:21:08.84,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SOLDIERS IN GAS MASKS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:18.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}If you were gassed, the system had a special lane for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:20.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Meuse-Argonne, the First Army had four gas
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hospitals.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:15.10,0:21:20.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:15.10,0:21:20.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:15.10,0:21:20.85,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:21:15.10,0:21:20.85,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GASSED MAN CARRIED TO A DUGOUT
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:31.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In March 1918, one Army nurse wrote in her diary
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}that she received 68 gassed men on her floor, mostly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:39.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}mustard burns, from a single convoy of about 300 men
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}of the Forty-Second Division.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.59,0:21:34.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:28.59,0:21:34.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:28.59,0:21:34.34,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:21:28.59,0:21:34.34,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SOLDIERS IN GAS MASKS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Their clothes came off, because the clothes were
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}still poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.53,0:21:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They were washed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:49.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Mobile degassing units could give a man a two-minute
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The eyes were rinsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:53.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Damaged lungs got bed rest and oxygen.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.07,0:21:47.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 995 0 l 995 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:42.07,0:21:47.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:42.07,0:21:47.82,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:21:42.07,0:21:47.82,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GAS ALARM · AMERICAN TROOPS · AISNE-MARNE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:56.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Here is the strange thing about gas in the First
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}World War.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:21:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was not usually what killed men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.86,0:22:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was what filled the beds.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.18,0:21:59.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:54.18,0:21:59.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:54.18,0:21:59.93,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:21:54.18,0:21:59.93,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GAS CLOUD ACROSS NO-MAN'S-LAND
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.87,0:22:14.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Gas injuries, as one hospital history put it, had
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:17.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}high morbidity and low mortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.47,0:22:18.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Many were hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Few, by comparison, died.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.12,0:22:16.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:11.12,0:22:16.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:11.12,0:22:16.87,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:22:11.12,0:22:16.87,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A GAS CLOUD ACROSS NO-MAN'S-LAND
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the British Army, later research found, mustard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}killed about two and a half of every hundred men it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:30.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}injured, the lowest death rate of the main war gases.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:33.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}What it did was take men out of the fight, for weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:33.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}at a time.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:21.39,0:22:27.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:21.39,0:22:27.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:21.39,0:22:27.14,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · BRITISH TRAINING FILM · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:22:21.39,0:22:27.14,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SOLDIERS IN GAS MASKS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:37.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In June 1918, the Army created the Chemical Warfare
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:38.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today, Army medical units still drill in gas masks.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.53,0:22:40.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1253 0 l 1253 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.53,0:22:40.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.53,0:22:40.28,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LANDSTUHL, GERMANY · NOV. 2026 · U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.53,0:22:40.28,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: GAS-MASK DRILL · ARMY HOSPITAL CENTER · TRAINING
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.56,0:22:45.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But for the men who were not gassed, the ones with
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}broken bones and torn muscle and steel inside them,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.77,0:22:50.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the field hospital was only a stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The real surgery was waiting further back.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:42.81,0:22:48.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:42.81,0:22:48.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:22:42.81,0:22:48.56,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:22:42.81,0:22:48.56,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. HOSPITAL TRAIN · FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On paper, the evacuation hospitals stood nine to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}fifteen miles behind the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.45,0:23:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This was where a wounded man could expect his real
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:05.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}operation.
