Dialogue: 3,0:22:56.71,0:23:02.46,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}AN OPERATING ROOM, ALLEREY HOSPITAL CENTER (EMPTY)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.98,0:23:29.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Teams often worked two tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:32.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}While one patient was on the first, the second table
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.59,0:23:34.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}was cleaned and the next man brought in.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.23,0:23:33.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
