Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Belleau Wood in June, Evacuation Hospital Number
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seven had no operating equipment of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:44.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its surgeons did all their operations on the four
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.76,0:23:47.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}tables of Mobile Hospital Number One.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:35.54,0:23:41.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 982 0 l 982 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:23:35.54,0:23:41.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:23:35.54,0:23:41.29,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. HISTORY, VOL. VIII (1925)
Dialogue: 3,0:23:35.54,0:23:41.29,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}RECEPTION WARD, MOBILE HOSPITAL NO. 39
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Anesthesia was ether or chloroform.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.90,0:23:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A British anesthetist, Geoffrey Marshall, found that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.25,0:23:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}both were dangerous for men already in shock, and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}pushed for nitrous oxide and oxygen instead.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:47.89,0:23:53.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
