Dialogue: 3,0:23:47.89,0:23:53.64,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:23:47.89,0:23:53.64,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. ARMY HOSPITAL WARD · ST. NAZAIRE AREA
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:02.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Needles and syringes were not thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.03,0:24:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They were sterilized, re-sharpened, and used again.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:59.95,0:24:05.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1188 0 l 1188 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:23:59.95,0:24:05.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:23:59.95,0:24:05.26,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:23:59.95,0:24:05.26,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL TENTS AND ARMY NURSES · 28TH DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.09,0:24:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And during the fighting at Soissons that summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.06,0:24:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}about 1,500 patients lay waiting for surgery at a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.10,0:24:28.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}single field hospital, while the surgeons worked
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.07,0:24:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}24-hour shifts for eight days.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:19.34,0:24:25.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1338 0 l 1338 132 l 0 132{\p0}
