Dialogue: 3,0:24:19.34,0:24:25.09,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. HISTORY, VOL. VIII (1925)
Dialogue: 3,0:24:19.34,0:24:25.09,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIRST-AID STATION, 1ST DIVISION, MISSY-AUX-BOIS · JULY 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:32.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}What did the surgeon actually do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:36.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He fought the infection the only way anyone could in 1918.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.59,0:24:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}With a knife.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:30.63,0:24:36.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:30.63,0:24:36.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:30.63,0:24:36.38,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:24:30.63,0:24:36.38,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. ARMY HOSPITAL WARD · ST. NAZAIRE AREA
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.13,0:24:51.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Dead tissue was where gas gangrene grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.32,0:24:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Take it away, and you took away its home.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:49.38,0:24:53.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1188 0 l 1188 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:49.38,0:24:53.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:49.38,0:24:53.97,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:24:49.38,0:24:53.97,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL TENTS AND ARMY NURSES · 28TH DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.02,0:24:57.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The method had been revived by a Belgian surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:25:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Antoine Depage, and was written up by surgeons
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.18,0:25:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}serving with the British forces in 1915.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.78,0:25:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By the time the Americans arrived, it was the rule.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:54.27,0:25:00.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:54.27,0:25:00.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:54.27,0:25:00.02,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. HISTORY, VOL. II (1927)
Dialogue: 3,0:24:54.27,0:25:00.02,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A SURGICAL WARD, ALLEREY HOSPITAL CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.92,0:25:21.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The laboratories fighting it were improvised too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.19,0:25:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Base Hospital No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}28, there was no proper incubator for these
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.38,0:25:28.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}oxygen-hating bacteria, so the staff built one from
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.78,0:25:30.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a ten-gallon gasoline can.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:18.17,0:25:23.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 888 0 l 888 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:25:18.17,0:25:23.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:25:18.17,0:25:23.92,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:25:18.17,0:25:23.92,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL WARDS GO UP · SAVENAY, FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then, instead of sewing the wound shut, surgeons
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.70,0:25:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}often left it open, and closed it a few days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.61,0:25:37.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}once it was clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.63,0:25:39.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This was called delayed primary closure.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:31.21,0:25:36.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
