Dialogue: 3,0:25:31.21,0:25:36.96,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:25:31.21,0:25:36.96,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. ARMY HOSPITAL WARD · ST. NAZAIRE AREA
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.55,0:26:21.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At a British general hospital far behind the lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.75,0:26:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}by comparison, he noted that men often arrived about
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.01,0:26:27.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}three days after they were wounded.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.80,0:26:24.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
