Dialogue: 3,0:26:18.80,0:26:24.55,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:26:18.80,0:26:24.55,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. HOSPITAL TRAIN · FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:45.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}There was the 12-hour clock again.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
