Dialogue: 3,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.74,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:26:43.67,0:26:45.74,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TENT CAMP · MEUSE-ARGONNE
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.79,0:26:48.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And to find steel inside a man, they had a new tool:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.72,0:26:49.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the X-ray.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:46.04,0:26:49.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 l 950 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:46.04,0:26:49.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:26:46.04,0:26:49.68,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. HISTORY, VOL. II (1927)
Dialogue: 3,0:26:46.04,0:26:49.68,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A SURGICAL WARD, ALLEREY HOSPITAL CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.60,0:27:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}There was no shielding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.94,0:27:16.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Doctors who looked through the fluoroscope screen
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}with their bare hands in the beam later suffered
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.57,0:27:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}radiation burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.50,0:27:21.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The healers paid, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:12.85,0:27:18.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
