Dialogue: 3,0:27:12.85,0:27:18.60,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. ARMY HOSPITAL WARD · ST. NAZAIRE AREA
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.23,0:27:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And some wounds needed a specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.53,0:27:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At a British casualty clearing station during the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.67,0:27:30.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}fighting at Passchendaele in 1917, the American
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.68,0:27:33.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}surgeon Harvey Cushing operated on soldiers with
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.75,0:27:35.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}wounds to the brain.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:22.48,0:27:28.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1424 0 l 1424 132 l 0 132{\p0}
