Dialogue: 3,0:27:22.48,0:27:28.23,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL NO. 13, 1ST DIVISION, VAUX, ARDENNES · NOV. 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.20,0:27:48.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A modern review points out he borrowed much of his
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.11,0:27:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}method from European surgeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.86,0:27:53.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But the numbers suggest what practice under fire could do.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:45.45,0:27:51.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
