Dialogue: 3,0:33:36.14,0:33:41.89,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL TENTS AND ARMY NURSES · 28TH DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.38,0:34:11.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In a letter home from Paris in April 1918, a week
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.55,0:34:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}into a new job, she was honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.56,0:34:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}I have been, she wrote, simply floundering.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:08.63,0:34:14.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1188 0 l 1188 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:34:08.63,0:34:14.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
