Dialogue: 3,0:34:08.63,0:34:14.38,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FIELD HOSPITAL TENTS AND ARMY NURSES · 28TH DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.55,0:34:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the Army needed more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:32.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In May 1918, it approved an Army School of Nursing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.72,0:34:36.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In five months, it received eleven thousand applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.24,0:34:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Its first dean was Annie Goodrich.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:27.80,0:34:33.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1063 0 l 1063 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:34:27.80,0:34:33.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:34:27.80,0:34:33.55,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1919 · FORD FILM COLLECTION, NATIONAL ARCHIVES
Dialogue: 3,0:34:27.80,0:34:33.55,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY GENERAL HOSPITAL NO. 36 · DETROIT
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.59,0:34:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Once your wound was cleaned and closed, or your
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.77,0:34:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}fever broke, it was time to move again. Further back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.34,0:34:59.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Much further.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:51.84,0:34:57.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:34:51.84,0:34:57.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
