Dialogue: 3,0:34:51.84,0:34:57.59,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. HOSPITAL TRAIN · FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.04,0:35:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}From the evacuation hospitals, the wounded went back
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.50,0:35:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}by train.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.10,0:35:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An ambulance carried four.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.83,0:35:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A hospital train carried up to 400.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:02.29,0:35:08.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1167 0 l 1167 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:35:02.29,0:35:08.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:35:02.29,0:35:08.04,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. HISTORY, VOL. VIII (1925)
Dialogue: 3,0:35:02.29,0:35:08.04,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INTERIOR OF A HOSPITAL TRAIN WARD CAR · BEDS RAISED
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.62,0:35:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army ran its hospital trains like a railroad of
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.33,0:35:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Ward cars with tiers of stretcher racks, a pharmacy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.53,0:35:18.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}car, a kitchen car.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:10.87,0:35:16.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 982 0 l 982 132 l 0 132{\p0}
