Dialogue: 3,0:35:10.87,0:35:16.62,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL TRAIN · METHOD OF LOADING
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.72,0:35:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Sometimes a train was sidetracked on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.30,0:35:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Army's own history admits that some of those
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.05,0:35:39.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}delays cost lives.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:32.97,0:35:38.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:35:32.97,0:35:38.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:35:32.97,0:35:38.72,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:35:32.97,0:35:38.72,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. HOSPITAL TRAIN · FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.53,0:35:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At the end of the line were the base hospitals, far
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.89,0:35:44.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}from the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.07,0:35:47.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Base Hospital 28, at Limoges, was about 200 miles
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.30,0:35:48.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}from the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.28,0:35:51.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Some were built from scratch, row after row of
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.31,0:35:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}wooden wards.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:39.78,0:35:45.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 888 0 l 888 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:35:39.78,0:35:45.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
