Dialogue: 3,0:35:39.78,0:35:45.53,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL WARDS GO UP · SAVENAY, FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.62,0:35:55.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Others moved into whatever was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.02,0:35:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At Vichy, the spa town, hotels became part of an
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.13,0:35:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Army hospital center.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:52.87,0:35:58.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1146 0 l 1146 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:35:52.87,0:35:58.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:35:52.87,0:35:58.62,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY PHOTO · MEDICAL DEPT. HISTORY, VOL. II (1927)
Dialogue: 3,0:35:52.87,0:35:58.62,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A WARD, BASE HOSPITAL NO. 1, VICHY HOSPITAL CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.75,0:36:16.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Base Hospital No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.84,0:36:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}4, the Cleveland unit that had sailed first, treated
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.17,0:36:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}eighty-two thousand, one hundred and seventy-nine
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.30,0:36:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}cases in twenty months.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:16.00,0:36:21.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1060 0 l 1060 132 l 0 132{\p0}
