Dialogue: 3,0:37:37.44,0:37:43.19,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL SHIP U.S.S. MERCY
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.01,0:37:54.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.91,0:37:57.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Statue of Liberty through the haze.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:54.26,0:37:57.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
