Dialogue: 3,0:37:54.26,0:37:57.83,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOMECOMING · NEW YORK HARBOR
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.88,0:38:00.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Signal Corps cameras filmed the wounded being
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.84,0:38:03.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}carried down the gangways, past Red Cross
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.31,0:38:06.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}volunteers, and loaded into Army ambulances on the pier.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:58.13,0:38:03.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:37:58.13,0:38:03.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:37:58.13,0:38:03.88,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1919 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:37:58.13,0:38:03.88,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WOUNDED COME HOME · NEW YORK
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.98,0:38:24.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In April 1917 it had a hundred and twenty-one patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.11,0:38:28.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1918 alone, it admitted more than thirteen thousand.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:20.23,0:38:25.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:38:20.23,0:38:25.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:38:20.23,0:38:25.98,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1919 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:38:20.23,0:38:25.98,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WOUNDED COME HOME · NEW YORK
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.69,0:38:31.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Men who had lost a limb began the long work of
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.83,0:38:34.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}learning to live with an artificial one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.55,0:38:37.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}According to the National World War I Museum, more
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.96,0:38:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}than 4,400 Americans received treatment and
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.89,0:38:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}artificial limbs.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:28.94,0:38:34.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1063 0 l 1063 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:38:28.94,0:38:34.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:38:28.94,0:38:34.69,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1919 · FORD FILM COLLECTION, NATIONAL ARCHIVES
Dialogue: 3,0:38:28.94,0:38:34.69,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY GENERAL HOSPITAL NO. 36 · DETROIT
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When the war began, most American limb makers still
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.69,0:38:48.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}carved artificial legs from wood by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.26,0:38:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The war changed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.58,0:38:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Walter Reed got its own prosthetic laboratory.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:42.75,0:38:48.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1063 0 l 1063 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:38:42.75,0:38:48.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:38:42.75,0:38:48.50,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1919 · FORD FILM COLLECTION, NATIONAL ARCHIVES
Dialogue: 3,0:38:42.75,0:38:48.50,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. ARMY GENERAL HOSPITAL NO. 36 · DETROIT
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.45,0:39:34.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1921, the Veterans Bureau was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.07,0:39:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The country was learning that the care of a wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.34,0:39:39.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}soldier does not end when the war does.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:31.70,0:39:37.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 910 0 l 910 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:31.70,0:39:37.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:31.70,0:39:37.45,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1919 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:39:31.70,0:39:37.45,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}VICTORY PARADE · FIFTH AVENUE, NEW YORK
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.28,0:39:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So what did all this leave us?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:40.53,0:39:42.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 910 0 l 910 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:40.53,0:39:42.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:40.53,0:39:42.22,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1919 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:39:40.53,0:39:42.22,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}VICTORY PARADE · FIFTH AVENUE, NEW YORK
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.17,0:39:57.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Those ideas still run through military medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.16,0:39:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today, soldiers testing for the Army's expert
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.97,0:40:03.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}badges, including the Expert Field Medical Badge,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.03,0:40:05.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}are still tested on their skills in the field.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:54.42,0:40:00.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:54.42,0:40:00.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:39:54.42,0:40:00.17,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FORT HOOD, TEXAS · NOV. 7, 2026 · U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:39:54.42,0:40:00.17,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: EXPERT BADGE TESTING (E3B) · TRAINING
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1918, the clock was 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.62,0:40:12.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The men who fought it were bearers with blistered
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.10,0:40:15.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hands, drivers in Model T Fords, surgeons on their
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.64,0:40:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}third day without sleep, and nurses who never came home.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:06.61,0:40:12.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
