Dialogue: 3,0:40:06.61,0:40:12.36,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:40:06.61,0:40:12.36,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STRETCHER BEARERS · 42ND DIVISION
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.06,0:40:24.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Meuse-Argonne American Cemetery, which holds
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.37,0:40:28.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}more American war dead than any other in Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.43,0:40:30.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}14,246 Americans are buried.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:20.31,0:40:26.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 995 0 l 995 132 l 0 132{\p0}
