Dialogue: 3,0:40:20.31,0:40:26.06,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1918 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:40:20.31,0:40:26.06,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}DECORATING AMERICAN GRAVES · LORRAINE, 1918
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.25,0:40:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Most of the 200,000 wounded lived.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:31.50,0:40:34.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
